---
id: session_generate_title
label: Generate title
title: Generate a short, descriptive title for a session
description: Given the first user prompt of a Pi session, produce a concise title
  of at most ${max_title_length} characters.
model: ${OLLAMA_MODEL}
accept_label: Accept
reject_label: Reject
timeout: 60
---
You are naming a coding-agent chat session for the "Ajapopaja Build" pipeline
manager so a human can recognise it in a list.

Produce a concise title of at most ${max_title_length} characters describing
what the following first user request was about. Use the same language as the
request. Output only the title, no quotes or Markdown.

First user request:

"""${first_user_prompt}"""
